It covers the full CRUD surface — reads via `useMemos`, `useInfiniteMemos`, `useMemo`, `useMemoComments`, `useInfiniteMemoComments`, and `useLinkMetadata`; writes via `useCreateMemo` (line 178), `useUpdateMemo` (197), and `useDeleteMemo` (253) — plus a `memoKeys` key factory and helpers that patch cached list/infinite data after a mutation.

The client itself is `memoServiceClient` from `web/src/connect.ts`, created with `createClient(MemoService, transport)` against the generated types in `web/src/types/proto/api/v1/memo_service_pb.ts`.
